      "message": "It would be nice to consolidate some common portions of master and slave mode read/write functions. Perhaps you can remove this loop in favor of something like:\n\nrv \u003d wait_status(port, SR1_TxE); /* extra wait for master-initiated transfer */\nif (i2c_write_raw(port, data, size) !\u003d size)\n        rv \u003d EC_ERROR_UNKNOWN;\n\n(side note: \"i2c_write_raw\" was originally named to differentiate between raw I2C mode and SMBus mode. Since we don\u0027t use SMBus mode, maybe there is a better name for it?)",
